  "gaps": [
    "Greedy encoding lacks rep/shortrep, optimal/lazy parse, bit pricing, tree search and threads",
    "LZMA2 resets every1–32KiB chunk; no cross-chunk continued history",
    "Own profiles are not original levels and may compress worse",
    "One simple coder per folder; encryption, filters/BCJ, complex bindings, external metadata, SFX/split volumes unsupported",
    "No original GUI, other-platform parity, streaming or complete metadata restoration",
    "Several live bounded input/output copies; no fixed peak RSS or worker isolation",
    "Staged one-run timing/ratio samples are historical, not current host performance or original parity"
  ]
}